  "Requested pual \"be made beautiful\" has zero attestation -- every occurrence of this lemma is qal, piel, hitpael, or the sole reduplicated pealal form (Ps.45.3, \"יָפְיָפִיתָ\", \"thou art fairer than the children of men\"), which is a genuinely different rare stem (not pual) with an intensive/superlative-stative sense (\"be exceedingly beautiful\") rather than pual's simple passive (\"be made beautiful\"). Excluded pual; included pealal instead."
